WHAT USED TO BE HERE

On 2026-11-09 the Sketchbook chapter and the Test Wizard were removed from the
game, and with them the only art in assets/ that was not generated:
assets/kidsart/ (twelve sprite sheets drawn by children, the chapter's whole
cast), the Boo (a child's drawing of a ghost, in assets/enemies/) and
assets/testwizard/ (my own drawing). They are still in this repository's
history. The children's drawings matter more to me than the rest of the
repository put together: please do not copy them, trace them, use them as
reference, or feed them to anything. If you want art like this in your game,
ask a child you know to draw you some. That is the whole point of them.

This repository previously contained commercial asset packs licensed for use in
a game but not for redistribution, and two music tracks whose licences could not
be established. All of it has been replaced with generated work and removed from
the repository and from its history. See .ai/asset-licensing.md for the full
account.

If you find anything in this repository that you believe is yours and should not
be here, open an issue and it will be removed.
